fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zkImjPou\">可设定一定观测指标决策账户是否有高频次更新价值，例如最近一次消耗时间、最近一次变更时间</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xTbdlvyx\">可查询<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1834548530596872\" target=\"_blank\">【获取不活跃账户列表】</a>接口判定是否活跃，不活跃账户基本不会产生数据变动（例如没有进行营销投放则不会产生营销数据），不建议高频次频繁更新获取。</p></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-TAHXp5xW\" id=\"h490b8bf-TAHXp5xW\">技术方案设计</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22go%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%2F%2F%20%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%BD%93%5Cntype%20InactiveCache%20struct%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctsync.RWMutex%5Cn%5Ctdata%20%20%20%20%20%20%20map%5Bint64%5Dstruct%7B%7D%5Cn%5CtlastUpdate%20time.Time%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvar%20cache%20%3D%20%26InactiveCache%7B%5Cn%5Ctdata%3A%20make(map%5Bint64%5Dstruct%7B%7D)%2C%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E4%B8%8D%E6%B4%BB%E8%B7%83%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%BB%EF%BC%88%E5%B8%A6%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5%EF%BC%89%5Cnfunc%20refreshInactiveCache(accessToken%20string)%20error%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctctx%20%3A%3D%20context.Background()%5Cn%5Ctconf%20%3A%3D%20config.NewConfiguration()%5Cn%5CtapiClient%20%3A%3D%20ad_open_sdk_go.NewAPIClient(conf)%5Cn%5Cn%5CtpageSize%20%3A%3D%20int64(100)%20%2F%2F%20%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%86%E9%A1%B5%E9%87%8F%5Cn%5Ctvar%20page%20int64%20%3D%201%5Cn%5Cn%5Ctfor%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctresp%2C%20httpRes%2C%20err%20%3A%3D%20apiClient.ToolsInactiveAdvertiserListV30Api().Get(ctx).%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5CtAppAccessToken(accessToken).%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5CtPage(page).%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5CtPageSize(pageSize).%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5CtExecute()%5Cn%5Cn%5Ct%5Ctif%20err%20!%3D%20nil%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Ctreturn%20fmt.Errorf(%5C%22%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%20HTTP%25d%3A%20%25v%5C%22%2C%20httpRes.StatusCo