%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KU2V0%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content go\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-1JAEf8wd\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-mUrlV7e5\" id=\"h346b9f0-mUrlV7e5\">第三阶：事件驱动更新（SPI）</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-T3LyHU2r\" id=\"h490b8bf-T3LyHU2r\">为什么需要SPI消息通知？</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-o3DCRXlA\">▶️ <strong>痛点直击</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-HZAJLdTY\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DVODHcE8\">❌ <em>“每隔5分钟轮询接口，却错过了瞬间的竞价波动...”</em>\n\n❌ <em>“人工盯守审核状态，深夜的紧急修改迟迟未触发动作...”</em></p></blockquote><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-F3VFUq0p\" id=\"h490b8bf-F3VFUq0p\">SPI如何成为您的“业务雷达”？ </h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-g6nogLpK\" id=\"h6f20189-g6nogLpK\"> 极简三步构建通知网</h3><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-AKdgB8Ec\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5Ei0BmTY\"><strong>订阅</strong>：设置您关心的触发条件（如 \"<!--dhy-gksh-->状态变更\"）  </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6G68OOUg\"><strong>感知</strong>：平台实时捕捉变动，主动推送消息至您的订阅地址</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GFJkT6Yj\"><strong>行动动</strong>：依据消息内容调用相关API拉取详情，秒级响应业务变化</li></ol><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-HOMjleaR\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/423a8369dcdd49a480b6727aa3931309~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138579&amp;x-signature=Vc%2Fh8Xb%2Bs14OKnKvR8m1%2B%2BzXs3I%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7WLYepCB\"><br/></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-PJKuVe7W\" id=\"h6f20189-PJKuVe7W\"> 核心优势拆解</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-kpgOe4kl\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-foSglt7m\"><col data-id=\"c48a81e3-kC93Yb6Y\" span=\"1\" width=\"31.171786120591584%\"/><col data-id=\"cc809561-K67OIRf6\" span=\"1\" width=\"34.69852104664392%\"/><col data-id=\"c3a2ced5-D73FnCN3\" span=\"1\" width=\"34.129692832764505%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-FmIuucqZ\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-8oKfqF2D\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-I555zwia\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uXg0IrnT\">传统轮询模式</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-HtmT8grK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mpot6KT7\">SPI消息触发模式</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-X1qnZ5wr\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lP2bfJE4\">对比优势</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-ZZjmHbK9\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-aUcpO5WR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1kN02vHJ\">❓ 盲猜时机</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-4W1JdF9W\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JciRSIAk\">🔔 精准事件驱动</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-OUk1FYB5\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-P0ZO2vCA\">告别“守株待兔”的焦虑</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-fJGriqAY\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-FV7fIa3d\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-laeUeDoX\">💸 高接口成本</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-7PXZG7iU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mwCx9GaV\">💰 零无效请求</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-1HL74pHd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z9bjvi9L\">每一分资源都用在刀刃上</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-V4QFlbU5\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-bjIacoYh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KY8lPP2H\">🐢 分钟级延迟</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-LAVBJOkh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-98F7Ut7W\">⚡ 毫秒级触达</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tdf77321-f28BbhJH\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4BWobP2h\">快人一步锁定战机</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%224COGi%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-NlgFsQgV%5C%22%3E%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%8A%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%8F%98%E5%8A%A8%E3%80%81%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E5%8F%98%E5%8A%A8%E7%AD%89%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A6%E6%83%85%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1722468664901647%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8B%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NlgFsQgV\">目前已支持报表数据变动、营销状态变动等消息类型，详情可参考【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1722468664901647\" target=\"_blank\">订阅服务类型</a>】</p></div></div></div><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-pCSMZvxV\" id=\"h490b8bf-pCSMZvxV\">实战示例</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-c3Oow9gx\"><strong>▶ 客户痛点</strong></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-OHm4FnZh\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FYJj46N2\">某游戏公司上线新游，需秒级感知投放数据波动（消耗突增/转化率下跌），传统每小时拉取报表导致：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OjEFJ6OX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GKEWnVdS\">异常消耗发现延迟，竞争产品抢量时段错失调价机会</li></ul></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-8zn2VBAo\"><strong>▶ SPI解决方案</strong></p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-8bmN5CIA\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-clAPPa6G\"><strong>创建订阅任务，并配置回调地址</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-OTNm84DU\"> <img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/f6cab2e6b681465786891c8cef98d4d2~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138612&amp;x-signature=N8iKPlUZPUzS9AqluJY0WDwjU7Q%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/412c16ef2623448bb923c19850e081f8~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138619&amp;x-signature=vaXnQo1VR4ZINbXFeZbCNDS4DAo%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-LiIy90lO\">可在创建订阅页面，选择订阅应用，设置订阅规则条件以及推送间隔</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cPEQO%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-NlgFsQgV%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%9A%E7%AC%A6%E5%90%88%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E9%80%81%E8%87%B3%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E3%80%82%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E2%80%8B%3Ca%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Flabels%2F7%2Fdocs%2F1722470671604747%5C%22%3E%E2%80%8BSPI%E5%9B%9E%E8%B0%83%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%8B%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NlgFsQgV\"><strong>回调地址</strong>：符合订阅条件的消息内容，会发送至设置的回调地址。回调地址如何开发可参考：【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1722470671604747\" target=\"_blank\">SPI回调地址设置</a>】</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-u2lv1sIb\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/1175cb014d3e4204bb1095716fb60d2a~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138684&amp;x-signature=ZVhYSs9%2BMxlxBi2nDcYtVf4Ilr4%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><ol data-id=\"oa950d4e-LJW8GHCW\" start=\"2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SRqnFlh2\"><strong>收到消息后，调用相关API接口获取详情信息</strong></li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-UJyYgWVz\">例如订阅营销项目数据变动事件，消息内容中会包含以下信息。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3XRaKxKr\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/db4ae9df4277488a8748b27b80ed914c~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138692&amp;x-signature=Su9yazJQlLDa0dcy07Md9EALblc%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3GEcT6zK\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/84935aeec4c840a9acb2aac5bed87c45~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2065138697&amp;x-signature=On9ErgQQBwnCWeElp2Yqf3ut5%2B4%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6O6pal7x\"><strong>确认请求接口所需参数</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-hDkDe4dC\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IGVMHsBY\">事件类型：可通过service_label确认本次消息所属事件类型</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8ZSPBFLM\">AccessToken ：可通过返回app_id、core_user_id、advertiser_ids确认消息来源的订阅应用，授权用户以及对应触发的业务账户id</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3A8aVHVO\">业务对象：例如可根据返回project_ids确认具体变动的项目ID</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-fSV2Lsbr\"><strong>发送接口请求获取详细信息</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OXmR8rEW\">以项目报表数据为例，确认请求参数信息后，可通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1741387668314126\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">自定义报表</a>】接口查询指定项目数据内容。</p><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZeeRAT39\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZeeRAT39\">您将收获的长期价值</h1><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-7BbbJcWd\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TO3MTvAb\">🌟 <strong>从“人找信息”到“信息找人”</strong>\n\n🌟 <strong>用确定性应对业务不确定性</strong>\n\n🌟 <strong>让技术资源专注于增长，而非等待</strong></p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-xuWXNEkG\"><strong>[立即行动]</strong> 点击开发者后台「订阅服务」→ 创建您的第一条SPI订阅！告别被动轮询，让关键数据主动“敲门”</p><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-D2XdIWOq\"><br/></p></div>",
